{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>נסי</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: ואל עמים ארים נסי. Just as there it is a literal נס (banner), as in וכנס על הגבעה, so too here a literal נס — that he called the Holy One, blessed be He, נסי (my banner) and ודגלי (my sign)."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:26.687202070Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}